  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction Sphere (at least one (blast type) talent that deals electricity damage)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you would force a creature in your reach to make a Reflex save against your destructive blast that deals electricity damage, you may instead make a melee attack roll with your destructive blast against the creature. On a successful hit, the target is treated as if they failed their Reflex save against the blast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
